---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, localBusinessSchema } from '../../config/site';

const procedureSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "MedicalProcedure",
  "name": "Intraoral Cameras – DFW Metroplex",
  "description": "See your smile the way we do with intraoral camera technology at Bear Creek Family Dentistry.",
  "procedureType": "https://schema.org/Therapeutic",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "Dentist",
    "name": "Bear Creek Family Dentistry",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "Dallas"
    }
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Intraoral Cameras Dallas | ${site.name}`}
  description="See your smile the way we do with intraoral camera technology at Bear Creek Family Dentistry."
  schema={[localBusinessSchema, procedureSchema]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary mb-4">
      <a href="/services" class="hover:underline">Services</a>
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-dark mb-4 leading-tight">
      Intraoral Cameras – DFW Metroplex
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-neutral-mid mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      See your smile the way we do with intraoral camera technology at Bear Creek Family Dentistry.
    </p>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed">
      <p class="mb-4">Intraoral cameras are small, handheld devices that allow our team to capture detailed images of the inside of your mouth in real time. Rather than relying solely on what we can see with the naked eye, these cameras let us show you exactly what's happening with your teeth and gums — making it easier to understand your diagnosis and feel confident in your treatment plan. At Bear Creek Family Dentistry, we use modern dental equipment including intraoral cameras as part of our commitment to thorough, transparent care.</p>
      
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/schedule" class="btn-primary">Book Your Visit</a>
      <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">View All Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>The camera itself is slender and can comfortably capture crystal clear images of any current tooth damage or decay.</p>
      <p>Images are displayed so patients can see exactly what the dentist is describing rather than relying on verbal descriptions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
